    "en": {
      "name": "Flashforce Sword",
      "effect": "Banish (face-up) 1 random card from your opponent's hand (until the Standby Phase of the next turn), then if this card was Set before activation and it banished a monster, you can apply this effect based on its Level.\n\u25cf 4 or lower: Your opponent banishes all monsters with its same name from their hand, Deck, and GY.\n\u25cf 5 or higher: Add 1 Level 5 or higher monster with the same Type, Attribute, and/or Level from your Deck to your hand.\nYou can only activate 1 \"Flashforce Sword\" per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
